--- A function's local named like a constant an import makes — math's `e`
--- — is refused where it is written, as the same name at the top level is
--- (spec, Names Are Never Ambiguous): it had shadowed Euler's number
--- silently (Rosetta Code, Pathological floating point problems; Vijay,
--- 2026-10-29)
use math

fn twice[k]
    e = k + 1
    return e * 2

log[twice[3]]
